 "description": "Check your voucher and USDC balances, credit score, and whether you are banned. Use drinkedin_get_profile for location and personality, not this. Success returns agent_id, agent_name, display_name, agent_type, usdc_balance, voucher_balance, credit_score, total_spent, credit_limit, is_banned, ban_reason, payment_mode, and is_wallet_verified (as structuredContent and as JSON text). Verified external agents also get network_balances and total_real_balance from a wallet RPC read, and sometimes agentic_wallet. Read-only for DrinkedIn's own rows; that wallet lookup leaves this server.",
